a022623
Each drive watch runs on its own broker pipe

BrokerProcess.OpenWatchChannelAsync opens one drive pipe per watch and returns a
BrokerWatchChannel (IIndexDriveWatch) that decodes the host frames straight off the pipe.
BrokerIndexWatchSource is a thin StartAsync over the caller-owned process and keeps no
per-drive state. BrokerMftBlockProducer.CreateWatchSource returns it.

The watch-source tests are ported onto one handle per drive over a rewritten
ScriptedWatchBrokerHarness (in-process host, per-drive scripted watch runs). Every
[TestMethod] of the 13 base-commit files (c1d43784) is ported or named below.

