  -> HandleEndingWithoutAStop_FaultsTheDrivesCatchUp
- CatchUp.WaitForCatchUpAsync_SourceException_FaultsPendingWait
  -> WaitForCatchUpAsync_ChannelLoss_FaultsPendingWait

Dropped:
