  no source is configured only in FileIndexWatchTests, which keeps
  StartWatchingAsync_OnAMixedIndexWithoutASource_ThrowsInvalidOperation.
- Pump.StartWatchingAsync_WhenAlreadyWatching_ThrowsInvalidOperation: the
  contract is inverted (a drive already watching is left alone), covered by
  FileIndexPerDriveWatchTests.StartWatching_AlreadyWatching_DoesNotRestart.
- Pump.StopWatchingAsync_BeforeAWatchStarts_HasNoEffect: the contract is
  inverted (stopping a drive that is not watching throws), covered by
